"\n\n\n\n\n## Ordered\n\n## Review\nIt takes some time because they pull the noodles themselves when you order, but it's not a problem at all.  \nThere was a way to eat it deliciously, so I followed it.  \nThere is no separate bibim; you eat it as bibim and then add the icy dongchimi broth they gave you separately to eat it as mul-makguksu.  \nI recommend adding extra noodles!\n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n"